# Changelog

All notable changes to `@re-cinq/hal-engine` are documented here.

The format is [Keep a Changelog 1.1.0](https://keepachangelog.com/en/1.1.0/), and this project adheres to
[Semantic Versioning](https://semver.org/spec/v2.0.0.html). Entries are written for somebody installing the
package, not for somebody reading this repository's commit log.

## [Unreleased]

### Changed

- Tool input is now checked against the tool's `inputSchema` before the tool runs. A call that omits a
  required property or passes a value of the wrong type is returned to the model as a tool result that
  names the problem, and the tool is not invoked. Extra properties still pass through unchanged.
  Tools that hand-validated their input will now only receive input the schema already accepts, and
  tools that relied on seeing malformed input to produce their own error message no longer see it.
